{"availability":"available","full":"ulasmango-cmd/ai-call-agent","name":"ai-call-agent","description":"Portfolio case study for AI Call Agent — a self-hosted, multi-tenant, multilingual AI phone-agent platform where compliance is enforced outside the model. Live demo page included.","category":"Design","language":"HTML","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-03T18:05:49Z","updated":"2026-10-03T18:06:05Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ulasmango-cmd.github.io/ai-call-agent/","topics":["ai-agents","albanian","call-center","compliance","fastapi","gdpr","german","llm","multi-tenant","multilingual","nextjs","portfolio","self-hosted","voice-ai"],"demo":"https://ulasmango-cmd.github.io/ai-call-agent/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:01:53.879Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T07:01:53.879Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T07:01:53.879Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:01:53.879Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A self-hosted, multi-tenant, multilingual AI phone-agent platform — where compliance is enforced in Python before a dial is attempted, never by asking the model for permission.","[](#project-status) [](#what-is-verified) [](#ownership)","This repository is a portfolio case study, not a source mirror. The implementation is private and proprietary. See Ownership."],"features":["176 of 215 tools are declared stubs. The registry, permission gating and argument validation are done and tested; the bodies are not.","Telephony is API-only. Trunks, numbers, routing rules and dial-plan preview are modelled. The SIP gateway config has never been started. There is no SIPp suite.","The pgvector/HNSW retrieval path is written but never benchmarked — no Postgres on the development machine.","ToolInvocation is never persisted. Tool calls inside a conversation leave no durable trace.","AgentSession.summary() is never called, so the record that AI-disclosure text played is